  "reviewNotes": "Revision01 selected master is cleanplate+real RGBA car at transform0, no pop to old raster. Car rigid translation/reduction over4.5seconds, centered pivot(.65,.55), trajectory stays below tail-free interior-voice balloon037. Old wheel ripple/reflection and immutable-car mask removed entirely; independent far-right background rain stays beyond initial/current car alpha. Five actual balloons protected, masks for unmodified c1/c2/c3 reused. Hands/steering remain static and protected; lock/dashboard effects are narrative finite accents, not fake manual gestures. Targeted correction: four soft procedural contact ellipses (chassis+three visible tyre contacts), declared in normalized layer coordinates, painted under car with identical story transform. No image or pose changed. Current sourcev2 is preview only; source/master v3 must be rebuilt from shared layers.render at transform0 before final selection. Final shadow masterv3 produced by exact shared layers.render at transform0; letters copied unchanged fromv2. Contact-shadow option remains data-driven and only applies to this car sprite; all previous assets/manifests retained. Source-v3 byte hash verified before candidate.",
